---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy — Chaos of Zen"
  description="What data this site and Seriatim collect: as little as possible."
>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>

  <h2>The plugin</h2>
  <p>
    Seriatim makes no network connections of any kind. It does not phone
    home, check for updates, or transmit telemetry, usage data, or crash
    reports. Everything it does happens locally on your machine.
  </p>

  <h2>This website</h2>
  <p>
    This site uses <strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong> for aggregate
    traffic counts. It sets no cookies and performs no cross-site tracking —
    there is nothing here for a consent banner to disclose.
  </p>

  <h2>Payment</h2>
  <p>
    If you choose to pay for Seriatim, <strong>Lemon Squeezy</strong> is the
    merchant of record. Your payment details, billing address, and any tax
    information are handled entirely by Lemon Squeezy under their own
    privacy policy — none of it reaches this website or Chaos of Zen
    directly.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy: support@chaosofzen.com</p>
</Base>
